uecomment-2510267153","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99705","id":2510267153,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vn6MR","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-01T21:54:27Z","updated_at":"2024-12-01T21:54:27Z","body":"cc @kisg @migueldeicaza ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2510267153/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2511578379","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99705#issuecomment-2511578379","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99705","id":2511578379,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vs6UL","user":{"login":"Xseuguh","id":56976884,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTc2ODg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56976884?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xseuguh","html_url":"https://github.com/Xseuguh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xseuguh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xseuguh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xseuguh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xseuguh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xseuguh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xseuguh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xseuguh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xseuguh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xseuguh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-02T13:42:10Z","updated_at":"2024-12-02T13:42:10Z","body":"> Extra cleanup is probably fine, but I'm not sure what you are trying to do with static `StringName`s. What's the purpose of reinitialization of `StringName`s or class info? It (and most low level stiff like `OS`) probably can be preserved and reused, you only need to reinitialize scene tree and view/view controller.\r\n\r\nThe purpose of reinitializing `StringName` is to enable embedding Godot within an existing iOS app as an external module. Our goal is to ensure that all objects created by the Godot instance are removed when exiting its view. To do so, we initialize Godot when launching it via a button and deinitialize it when exiting the Godot view.\r\nTo achieve this, the `start` and `cleanup` methods from the main Godot code are used. However, invoking the `cleanup` method results in a reference error during the next launch attempt.\r\nTo address this error, we reinitialize `StringName`.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2511578379/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2511658177","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99705#issuecomment-2511658177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99705","id":2511658177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VtNzB","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-02T14:14:45Z","updated_at":"2024-12-02T14:14:45Z","body":"We did originally try the `clear` approach a year ago, but found it very brittle, but it did serve as a good proof-of-concept that we could relaunch Godot multiple times.\r\n\r\nFor the stated goal of this PR, we ended up going with a more robust approach which is the libgodot/DisplayServerEmbedded approach patch that @kisg and his team developed and you can see in action here, and solves the iOS embedding problem, but also allows for not just embedding one view, but can support multiple views in the same screen (among other things):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90510\r\n\r\nYou can take it for a spin on iOS with both Swift or Godot-cpp with the samples here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/migeran/libgodot_project\r\n\r\nThe patches here won't hurt, but in our view, are neither sufficient or desirable for the intended goal.   They did spot the challenging StringName issue, which is the ugliest part of the reset approach, but from memory, this is about a third of the static state that needs to be properly reset, there are plenty more globals and statics that need to be worked on.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2511658177/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3302313554","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99705#issuecomment-3302313554","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99705","id":3302313554,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E1U5S","user":{"login":"mobtex","id":5514723,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTQ3MjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5514723?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mobtex","html_url":"https://github.com/mobtex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mobtex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mobtex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mobtex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mobtex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mobtex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mobtex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mobtex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mobtex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mobtex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T10:17:01Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T10:17:01Z","body":"@louis-prudhomme I came across your project [EmbeddableGodot](https://github.com/louis-prudhomme/EmbeddableGodot)\r\n and I think your solution is really elegant. I would love to test it, but it looks like the repository is no longer available.\r\n\r\nWould it be possible for you to make it public again or share it somehow?\r\n\r\nThanks a lot in advance!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3302313554/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]